msgstr "操作"

msgid "Add"
msgstr "添加"

msgid ""
"After saving a list, show a reminder that changes take effect only after "
"applying them to ZeroBlock."
msgstr "保存列表后，提示只有将其应用到 ZeroBlock 后更改才会生效。"

msgid "Allowed in modes"
msgstr "允许的模式"

msgid "Apply ZeroBlock changes"
msgstr "应用 ZeroBlock 更改"

msgid "Attaching a list to a ZeroBlock section"
msgstr "将列表附加到 ZeroBlock 配置段"

msgid "Auto"
msgstr "自动"

msgid "Auto, Domains only"
msgstr "自动，仅域名"

msgid "Auto, IP only"
msgstr "自动，仅 IP"

msgid "Backups"
msgstr "备份"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Check mode"
msgstr "检查模式"

msgid "Check modes"
msgstr "检查模式"

msgid "Comment line"
msgstr "注释行"

msgid "Comments"
msgstr "注释"

msgid "Copied"
msgstr "已复制"

msgid "Copy path"
msgstr "复制路径"

msgid "Copy the list path on the Lists tab (\"Copy path\")."
msgstr "在列表标签页中复制列表路径（“复制路径”）。"

msgid "Delete"
msgstr "删除"

msgid "Delete list"
msgstr "删除列表"

msgid "Delete list \"%s\"? The file will be removed permanently."
msgstr "删除列表“%s”？文件将被永久移除。"

msgid "Deleting lists that are in use"
msgstr "删除正在使用的列表"

msgid "Domain"
msgstr "域名"

msgid "Domains only"
msgstr "仅域名"

msgid "Edit"
msgstr "编辑"

msgid "Edit list"
msgstr "编辑列表"

msgid "Empty line"
msgstr "空行"

msgid "Entries"
msgstr "条目数"

msgid "?"
msgstr "?"

msgid ""
"Entry formats verified against ZeroBlock full manual v0.8.4-r248, section 11."
msgstr "条目格式已对照 ZeroBlock 完整手册 v0.8.4-r248 第 11 节校验。"

msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "Failed to create list: %s"
msgstr "创建列表失败：%s"

msgid "Failed to delete list: %s"
msgstr "删除列表失败：%s"

msgid ""
"Failed to read the list file: %s. The editor stays closed so that the file "
"cannot be overwritten with empty content."
msgstr "读取列表文件失败：%s。编辑器保持关闭，以免文件被空内容覆盖。"

msgid "Failed to run ZeroBlock reload: %s"
msgstr "执行 ZeroBlock 重载失败：%s"

msgid "Failed to save list: %s"
msgstr "保存列表失败：%s"

msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

msgid ""
"Full-line comments (# ...) are ignored by ZeroBlock and are valid here. An "
"inline comment after an entry (%s) is still flagged: it is not documented, "
"and ZeroBlock's auto-detection is binary — a line with \"/\" or consisting "
"of digits and dots is treated as IP/CIDR, everything else silently becomes a "
"\"domain\". That is also why invalid lines are worth fixing: ZeroBlock will "
"never report them."
msgstr "整行注释（# ...）会被 ZeroBlock 忽略，在此处有效。条目后的行内注释（%s）仍会被标记：因为该格式未被文档记录，且 ZeroBlock 的自动检测是二元的——包含“/”或仅由数字和点组成的行被视为 IP/CIDR，其余都被静默当作“域名”。这也正是需要修正无效行的原因：ZeroBlock 本身永远不会报告它们。"

msgid "Grant access to LuCI user route lists app"
msgstr "授予 LuCI 用户路由列表应用访问权限"

msgid "Help"
msgstr "帮助"

msgid "IP only"
msgstr "仅 IP"

msgid "IPv4"
msgstr "IPv4"

msgid "IPv4 CIDR"
msgstr "IPv4 CIDR"

msgid "IPv6"
msgstr "IPv6"

msgid "IPv6 CIDR"
msgstr "IPv6 CIDR"

msgid ""
"If a file referenced by a ZeroBlock section disappears, then depending on "
"lists_failure_mode the section may be disabled (degrade) or the whole proxy "
"service may stop (teardown). Remove the path from the sections before "
"deleting a list."
msgstr "如果 ZeroBlock 配置段引用的文件消失，根据 lists_failure_mode 设置，该段可能被禁用（degrade），或整个代理服务可能停止（teardown）。删除列表前请先从各配置段中移除路径。"

msgid ""
"Invalid list name — allowed: letters, digits, \"-\" and \"_\", at most 32 "
"characters."
msgstr "无效的列表名称——允许使用字母、数字、“-”和“_”，最多 32 个字符。"

msgid "Leave"
msgstr "离开"

msgid "List name"
msgstr "列表名称"

msgid "Lists"
msgstr "列表"

msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

msgid ""
"No lists yet. Create the first one and attach it to a ZeroBlock section via "
"its file path."
msgstr "暂无列表。创建第一个列表，并通过文件路径将其附加到 ZeroBlock 配置段。"

msgid "Not saved: the file exceeds the %d KiB limit."
msgstr "未保存：文件超过 %d KiB 限制。"

msgid ""
"Not saved: the list has problems. Fix them or use \"Save with warnings/"
"errors\"."
msgstr "未保存：列表存在问题。请修正，或使用“保存（含警告/错误）”。"

msgid ""
"One entry per line, plain text. The following are rejected as errors because "
"the ZeroBlock file contract explicitly excludes them: %s prefixes, hosts-"
"style lines (%s) and adblock syntax (%s). Those notations only work when "
"entered manually inside a ZeroBlock section, not in list files."
msgstr "每行一条，纯文本。以下内容会被拒绝为错误，因为 ZeroBlock 文件约定明确将其排除：%s 前缀、hosts 格式行（%s）和 adblock 语法（%s）。这些写法仅在 ZeroBlock 配置段中手动输入时有效，在列表文件中无效。"

msgid "Open the desired section in ZeroBlock."
msgstr "在 ZeroBlock 中打开目标配置段。"

msgid "Paste the path into the \"User lists\" field and apply."
msgstr "将路径粘贴到“用户列表”字段并应用。"

msgid "Paste this path into the \"User lists\" field of a ZeroBlock section"
msgstr "将此路径粘贴到 ZeroBlock 配置段的“用户列表”字段"

msgid "Path"
msgstr "路径"

msgid ""
"Public, ready-made lists are better attached directly by URL in ZeroBlock; "
"this app is for maintaining your own local lists."
msgstr "公开现成列表建议直接在 ZeroBlock 中通过 URL 附加；本应用用于维护您自己的本地列表。"

msgid "Remove duplicates"
msgstr "删除重复项"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "保存"

msgid "Save & Apply"
msgstr "保存并应用"

msgid "Save with warnings/errors"
msgstr "保存（含警告/错误）"

msgid "Saved. Changes take effect after applying them to ZeroBlock."
msgstr "已保存。更改将在应用到 ZeroBlock 后生效。"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

msgid "Stay"
msgstr "留下"

msgid "Storage directory"
msgstr "存储目录"

msgid "Suggest applying ZeroBlock after saving"
msgstr "保存后提示应用 ZeroBlock"

msgid "Supported entry formats"
msgstr "支持的条目格式"

msgid "Switch to its Lists tab."
msgstr "切换到其“列表”标签页。"

msgid ""
"The check mode only affects validation in this app; ZeroBlock itself always "
"auto-detects each line. \"Auto\" accepts every valid entry type, \"Domains "
"only\" and \"IP only\" restrict the list to one entry type — useful to catch "
"mistakes in lists meant for a single purpose."
msgstr "检查模式仅影响本应用中的校验；ZeroBlock 本身始终自动检测每一行。“自动”接受所有有效条目类型，“仅域名”和“仅 IP”将列表限制为单一类型——有助于发现面向单一用途的列表中的错误。"

msgid ""
"The directory is fixed by the access policy (ACL). Changing it is only "
"possible by editing the ACL file manually."
msgstr "目录由访问策略（ACL）固定。只能通过手动编辑 ACL 文件来更改。"

msgid "The list has unsaved changes. Leave without saving?"
msgstr "列表有未保存的更改。是否不保存离开？"

msgid ""
"The lists (/etc/user-lists) and this app's settings are included in the "
"standard LuCI configuration backup. A sysupgrade without keeping settings "
"erases them — make a backup before flashing."
msgstr "这些列表（/etc/user-lists）以及本应用的设置已包含在标准 LuCI 配置备份中。不保留设置进行 sysupgrade 会清除它们——刷机前请备份。"

msgid ""
"This file is referenced by ZeroBlock section(s): %s. Depending on "
"lists_failure_mode, a missing file may disable the section or stop the whole "
"proxy service (teardown). Remove the path from the sections first."
msgstr "此文件被以下 ZeroBlock 配置段引用：%s。根据 lists_failure_mode 设置，缺失文件可能导致该段被禁用，或使整个代理服务停止（teardown）。请先从这些配置段中移除路径。"

msgid ""
"This file is referenced by ZeroBlock section(s): %s. The paths there are not "
"updated automatically — fix them manually after renaming."
msgstr "此文件被以下 ZeroBlock 配置段引用：%s。其中的路径不会自动更新——重命名后请手动修正。"

msgid ""
"This list is larger than %d KiB and cannot be saved back — the editor is "
"read-only. Edit the file over SSH."
msgstr "此列表大于 %d KiB，无法保存回写——编辑器为只读。请通过 SSH 编辑文件。"

msgid "Unsaved changes"
msgstr "未保存的更改"

msgid "User Lists"
msgstr "用户列表"

msgid "User Lists — Help"
msgstr "用户列表 — 帮助"

msgid "User Lists — Settings"
msgstr "用户列表 — 设置"

msgid ""
"User list files (domains / IP / CIDR) stored in %s. Attach a list to a "
"ZeroBlock section by pasting its file path into the section's \"User lists\" "
"field."
msgstr "用户列表文件（域名 / IP / CIDR）存储在 %s 中。通过将文件路径粘贴到 ZeroBlock 配置段的“用户列表”字段来附加列表。"

msgid "ZeroBlock reload failed: %s"
msgstr "ZeroBlock 重载失败：%s"

msgid "ZeroBlock reload finished successfully."
msgstr "ZeroBlock 重载成功完成。"

msgid ""
"adblock syntax is explicitly excluded by the ZeroBlock file contract (manual "
"11.1)"
msgstr "adblock 语法被 ZeroBlock 文件约定明确排除（manual 11.1）"

msgid "all"
msgstr "全部"

msgid "duplicate of line %d"
msgstr "第 %d 行的重复"

msgid ""
"hosts-style format is explicitly excluded by the ZeroBlock file contract "
"(manual 11.1)"
msgstr "hosts 格式被 ZeroBlock 文件约定明确排除（manual 11.1）"

msgid ""
"inline comments are not documented by ZeroBlock — the whole line may be "
"interpreted as a domain"
msgstr "行内注释未被 ZeroBlock 文档记录——整行可能被解释为域名"

msgid "line %d: %s"
msgstr "第 %d 行：%s"

msgid ""
"non-ASCII (IDN) domain is not documented by ZeroBlock — consider the "
"punycode form: %s"
msgstr "非 ASCII（IDN）域名未被 ZeroBlock 文档记录——请考虑使用 punycode 形式：%s"

msgid "not a domain (this list allows domains only)"
msgstr "不是域名（此列表仅允许域名）"

msgid "not a domain or IP/CIDR"
msgstr "不是域名或 IP/CIDR"

msgid "not an IP/CIDR (this list allows IP entries only)"
msgstr "不是 IP/CIDR（此列表仅允许 IP 条目）"

msgid ""
"prefixes are not supported in list files (ZeroBlock contract, manual 11.1) — "
"they only work when entered manually in a section"
msgstr "前缀在列表文件中不受支持（ZeroBlock 约定，manual 11.1）——仅在配置段中手动输入时有效"

msgid "…and %d more problem not shown"
msgid_plural "…and %d more problems not shown"
msgstr[0] "…还有 %d 个问题未显示"
